 ,a.`CanPrint`  , a.`MainID` as MainScreenID  , b.`Group_ID` as GRoup_ID , b.`EnglishName` , b.`ShortName`
 ,c.GroupNAme as GroupNAme

 from `UserAccessProfileTemplate` as a
inner join `FrmScreensTb2` as b on a.`ScreenID` = b.`ScreenID`
